{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"本研究的实际适应症为活动性中重度甲状腺眼病（TED=甲状腺眼病）。本章应围绕该适应症，逐项说明临床问题、当前标准治疗、未满足的临床需求以及本研究拟解决的证据不确定性。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：活动性中重度甲状腺眼病的临床问题，包括该适应症当前的疾病负担、主要治疗困境及对患者健康结局的影响：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p3\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：活动性中重度甲状腺眼病当前的标准治疗方案、适用条件及其可核查依据：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p4\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：活动性中重度甲状腺眼病本适应症人群尚未满足的临床需求，包括现有治疗无法充分覆盖的疗效、安全性或可及性需求：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"v2_n_2_1_p5\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"【待补充：本研究拟解决的、现有证据无法回答的不确定性，即本研究的证据缺口：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"6abc0994c495f60c744f70472f83c041843390a7ebf19e75737a23c7bfbdd98e"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:0a03364d451f82dd08168f78e7811f0e3a364d5047df8d744527e010ac29c16b:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:0a03364d451f82dd08168f78e7811f0e3a364d5047df8d744527e010ac29c16b:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-latest-cloud","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha25